      "short": "$\\frac{4}{15}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}1-\\frac{1}{3}-\\frac{2}{5}&=\\frac{15}{15}-\\frac{5}{15}-\\frac{6}{15}\\\\&=\\frac{15-5-6}{15}\\\\&=\\frac{4}{15}\\end{align*}$$\n$\\frac{4}{15}$ of the original herd remains at her ranch.",
